-Main files:
-
-- `final_feature_sets.npy`: dictionary of final feature sets by branch. With
-  `--run-ga`, each branch contains the ranked GA-RF top feature sets, so
-  `feature_sets["svm_l1"]` is a list of up to `ga.top_k` feature sets. Without
-  GA, these are RFECV target feature sets.
-- `best_feature_sets.npy`: dictionary of the single best GA feature set per
-  branch.
-- `ga/<method>/best_feature_set.npy`: best GA-selected feature names.
-- `ga/<method>/top_feature_sets.npy`: top GA feature sets.
-- `ga/<method>/top_masks.npy`: top GA boolean masks over the wrapper feature space.
-- `ga/<method>/checkpoint.json`: live GA status when `ga.checkpoint_dir` is set.
-- `ga/<method>/history_live.csv`: live per-generation best score history.
-- `ga/<method>/top_solutions_live.csv` and
-  `ga/<method>/top_feature_sets_live.npy`: live top GA solutions refreshed every
-  `ga.progress_interval` generations and at the final generation of each run.
-- `first_stage/<method>/selected_features.npy`: wrapper-selected candidate features.
-- `rfecv/<method>/target_features.npy`: feature names selected at the RFECV
-  target feature count.
-- `rfecv/<method>/summary.json`: RFECV-derived target feature count.
